  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/534/260/2022-12-04_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"449\" height=\"449\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\"><strong><strong>這是一個數據包！</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jLOz8nt.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"></strong></strong><strong><strong>&nbsp;Forge模組請至 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unwrecked-ships-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>下載</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bPe9GDA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"26\"></strong></strong><strong><strong>&nbsp;Fabric模組請至 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unwrecked-ships-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>下載</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><strong><strong><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshop.purehosted.net%252faff%252fwabi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#808000;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/12e69aa9dd8a00fb45de3a73c0452b2194e07eba.png\" alt=\"purehosted伺服器10%優惠券，unwrecked ships自訂橫幅\" width=\"600\" height=\"100\"></span></a></strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">你是否曾想過《Minecraft》原版中的<strong>沉船</strong>在完好時會是什麼模樣？不用再猜了！這個數據包會讓沉船修復後重新航行，自然生成在你的世界中！它們僅有少量改動（例如船帆和燈籠），且完全保留原版設計。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s8fEtY6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Unwrecked Ships 基礎版</strong>新增7種船隻變體，<em>僅使用</em>原版提供的木材類型與組合，且只有白色船帆。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PZ67H2c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;</span>Unwrecked Ships 加強版</strong>&nbsp;新增遊戲中<em>所有</em>木材類型與船帆顏色的組合，以及使用地獄專屬木材的地獄船隻。此外，部分船隻會配有船員，例如村民、掠奪者，而地獄船隻則會有豬布林。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">這個數據包理應能與大多數世界生成模組直接兼容，但若遇到任何不相容的情況，請在問題頁面中提交回報。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>圖片庫：</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/534/265/2022-12-04_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"762\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/534/269/2022-12-04_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"762\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/534/273/2022-12-04_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"758\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><strong>安裝方式：</strong></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><strong>此版本的 Unwrecked Ships 可作為數據包導入任何新世界。</strong></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>下載<strong>Unwrecked<strong>&nbsp;Ships</strong></strong>。</li>\n<li>開始創建新世界，選擇「數據包」選項。</li>\n<li>將 Unwrecked Ships 數據包拖放至「可用」區域，或開啟數據包資料夾並將數據包拖入目錄中。完成後按下「完成」。</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">查看我們的其他數據包：</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/revamped-shipwrecks-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1098920/description_0fb5046e-db7e-4520-a019-11a6b8af5fd2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/revamped-shipwrecks-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0a26ae\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Revamped Shipwrecks</span></strong></span></a></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/pale-formations-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/sJcvkhDc/5b1f4b7e261a4d31499986937acfcc660a8548cf.gif\" alt=\"Pale Formations 標誌\" width=\"187\" height=\"187\"></a><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><a style=\"color:#7e8c8d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/pale-formations-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Pale Formations</span></strong></a></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/wabi-sabi-structures-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1EiT59N.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"116\"></a><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/wabi-sabi-structures-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Wabi-Sabi Structures</span></span></a></span></strong></p>\n\n（注：已保留所有HTML標籤與連結結構，僅對文本內容進行繁體中文翻譯，並針對台灣用語習慣調整稱謂（如「數據包」保留大陸用語但符合台灣理解，「模組」為台灣常用說法）。圖片alt文字已根據上下文補充在地化描述）",
